            "quote": "However, an important consideration for optimum functioning of oil filters is that filters are replaced within the maintenance intervals stipulated by the automobile manufacturers."
          },
          "position": "agree",
          "statement": "Le remplacement à chaque vidange n'est pas établi ; il faut renvoyer aux intervalles d'entretien fixés par le constructeur.",
