            "path": "sources/auto-captures/filtre-a-huile/filtron-eu-wl-filtre-a-huile-clapets-b8431d6f.md",
            "quote": "The bypass valve is used when the filter is clogged due to a long period of time between replacements or when the vehicle is running at a low temperature (when the oil is cold and dense)."
