            "path": "sources/auto-captures/filtre-a-huile/mahle-aftermarket-com-wl-filtre-a-huile-conception-media-fa488c04.md",
            "quote": "A spin-on oil filter consists of housing and filter element, which are inseparably connected and must therefore be changed as a unit."
          },
          "position": "agree",
          "statement": "Les captures établissent le remplacement du filtre vissé en bloc ou le renouvellement de la cartouche, mais pas une interdiction générale de réutiliser tout filtre papier jetable.",
